* Tue Sep 22 2026 Jeremy Melanson <1080872+zish@users.noreply.github.com> - 1.0.0-1
- First package. Caps the container's PID namespace at pid_max=65536 so the
  counter wraps below the 32-bit bionic limit instead of walking past it
  (docs/51).
- Ships waydroid-pid-reset for a container already past the cliff, which
  recovers it without the container restart that would drop a kiosk session.
